Package: flumen
Type: Package
Title: An R Workflow Manager for Distributed Bioinformatics without Centralized Storage
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-11-20
Authors@R: person("Simone", "Caligola", email = "s.caligola@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Workflow manager for distributed bioinformatics with locality-aware scheduling, 
    cross-machine distribution via TCP, and multi-language
    tasks ('R', 'Python', shell). Uses 'Arrow' IPC for data transfer and 'NNG'
    sockets for low-latency messaging.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/simo1c/Flumen
BugReports: https://github.com/simo1c/Flumen/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    Rcpp,
    nanonext (>= 1.6.0),
    arrow,
    qs2,
    igraph,
    sys,
    uuid,
    rlang,
    methods,
    tools,
    stats,
    utils
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    bit64,
    jsonlite
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Python 3.9+ with pyarrow, pandas, numpy and pynng (optional, for Python ops)
